  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given sets is:\n\n**(First term)³ + (Second term)³ = Third term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(2, 3, 35)\n\n**(2)³** + **(3)³** = 35\n\n__**8 + 27**__ = 35 \n\n35 = 35\n\n(11, 6, 1547)\n\n(11)3 + (6)3 = 1547\n\n__1331 + 216__ = 1547\n\n1547 = 1547\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (4, 15, 3439)\n\n(4)3 + (15)3 = 3439\n__64 + 3375__ = 3439\n3439 = 3439\n\nOption 2) (10, 9, 1730)\n(10)3 + (9)3 = 1730\n__1000 + 729__ = 1730 \n1729 ≠ 1730\n\nOption 3) (7, 8, 2565)\n(7)3 + (8)3 = 2565\n__343 + 512__ = 2565\n855 ≠ 2565\n\nOption 4) (3, 12, 1296)\n(3)3 + (12)3 = 1296\n__27 + 1728__ = 1296\n1755 ≠ 1296\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 1).**",
